{#
calendar/_form.html.twig — create/rename a calendar inside the modal frame.

Delegates to _partials/_modal_form.html.twig, which supplies the
<turbo-frame id="modal"> wrapper Turbo needs to render the response into. The
label form does the same; without the frame the fetch finds nothing to swap and
the dialog sits on its spinner.

Field styling comes from the global form theme, including the colour swatches
(_calendar_color_widget), so the widgets render bare here.
#}
{% extends '_layout/app.html.twig' %}

{% block body %}
    {% include '_partials/_modal_form.html.twig' with {
        form: form,
        title: calendar.id is null ? 'calendar.form.add'|trans : 'calendar.form.edit'|trans,
    } only %}
{% endblock %}
